  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Syrian refugees and Lebanese host communities in North Lebanon: Integrated Health, WASH &amp; Livelihood support for Resilience and Sustainability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Akkar district in North Lebanon</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syrian refugees and Lebanese host communities</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall operational objective of this project is to bolster health, sanitation, and economic stability among vulnerable Syrian refugee and host communities in North Lebanon through sustainable livelihood support, enhanced WASH practices in settlements, local capacity building for enduring WASH solutions, and immediate access to free emergency healthcare services-</narrative>
  </description>
